	</p>

	<p>
		Former elected official in the Lyon Metropolitan area for 12 years, with responsibilities
		in culture, digital affairs, and international relations. President of the France-Formosa
		Association, promoting Franco-Taiwanese cultural and economic exchanges.
	</p>

	<p>
		Specialist in energy geopolitics, with particular expertise on Taiwan, the Indo-Pacific
		region, nuclear energy, energy transition, and the intersection of religion and geopolitics.
		Regular media commentator on energy markets, Taiwan-China relations, and strategic
		communications.
	</p>

	<p>
		Available for conferences, university lectures, media panels, training programs, and
